    {"pattern": "\\bcat\\b|feline|\\bdog\\b|canine|horse|equine|\\bcow\\b|cattle|bovine|\\bpig\\b|porcine|rabbit|hamster|\\bmouse\\b|\\brat\\b|guinea pig|gerbil|고양이|강아지|말\\b|토끼|햄스터|생쥐|기니피그", "category": "animal"},
